# Nothing secret should ever live in this repo, but belt and braces.
.env
*.local
*.log


parked/

personal/

# Session records used to live here. They now live in %LOCALAPPDATA%\vestibule, because
# a log inside the repo is editable by any session run from the repo -- which defeats the
# only reason to keep one.

# Worktrees, created inside the repo so a prepared branch lands on the host disk and
# survives the container. Ignored because an un-ignored .worktrees/ fills `git status`
# with a duplicate of the whole tree; the commits are in .git either way, so the checkout
# is disposable.
.worktrees/

# Per-project vestibule config -- the egress allowlist. `agent` creates it in whatever
# repo it is run from, and this repo is no exception
.vestibule/

# Personal rather than project convention.
CLAUDE.md
